 <paragraph index="169" node_type="writer">My computer only has a CPU, which means it can perform one operation at a time, and that is a problem for using Machine Learning for crop recognition. GPUs allow for several operations to be done in parallel, which is why they are useful for Machine Learning.</paragraph>
