 <paragraph index="431" node_type="writer">Conclusion for what is done so far </paragraph>
 <paragraph index="432" node_type="writer">My computer can now run OpenCV, ROS through Docker and Gazebo. My computer has enough capacity to hold the porject, except for the YOLOv5s training which will be done directly one the car LIMO PRO.</paragraph>
